{
 "schema": "fmc-recipe/0.1",
 "family": "FMC_A_SpecEq_BedheadTrunking_Horizontal",
 "template": "Metric Generic Model.rft",
 "about": "Bedhead trunking modelled as a generic product: curved aluminium body with gas, power and ELV covers, uplight diffuser and lens, end caps, four sockets, three gas outlets, nurse-call and data outlets, light switch, bed number. The services are also hosted by the E/P families in the project (record note); the connectors here carry the casing's load and gas points. Bottom at z = 0; Default Elevation 1300; geometry is the 1500 type. Reference: query: bedhead trunking horizontal specialty equipment hospital; images: https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=bedhead+trunking+horizontal+specialty+equipment+hospital; basis: generic product; brand, model and supplier open for review",
